 resting position."}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/fileImporter(isPresented:allowedContentTypes:allowsMultipleSelection:onCompletion:)":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/fileImporter(isPresented:allowedContentTypes:allowsMultipleSelection:onCompletion:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/fileimporter(ispresented:allowedcontenttypes:allowsmultipleselection:oncompletion:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fileImporter","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"isPresented","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Binding","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"allowedContentTypes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","